            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Jot Local now checks for signed updates and downloads them automatically.

- Use Check for Updates from the menu bar to check immediately.
- Automatic checks and downloads can be switched off in the menu bar.
- Updates ask before restarting and wait for active dictation work to finish.
- Downloaded updates can also install when you quit normally.
- Dictation, transcripts, settings, and local models remain on your Mac.

Requires macOS 14 or later and Apple Silicon. Install this first updater-enabled version manually; future versions can update in the app.
]]></description>
